#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:1
msgid "Q-VAE: Quantum Variational Autoencoder on MNIST"
msgstr "Q-VAE：MNIST 上的量子变分自编码器"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial combines [Section 4.2: Restricted Boltzmann Machine"
"](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-theoretical-foundations-bm-"
"restricted.md) with the VAE framework. It replaces the Gaussian prior of "
"a standard VAE with a quantum Boltzmann machine (QBM) and trains the "
"resulting Q-VAE on MNIST for both image generation and representation "
"learning. Building on the [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) training loop, "
"this tutorial adds the encoder–decoder structure and the KL term between "
"the encoder posterior and the QBM prior."
msgstr ""
"本教程将[第 4.2 节：受限玻尔兹曼机](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-theoretical-"
"foundations-bm-restricted.md)与 VAE 框架相结合。它用量子玻尔兹曼机（QBM）替代标准 VAE 的高斯先验，并在 "
"MNIST 上训练得到的 "
"Q-VAE，用于图像生成与表示学习。基于[快速入门](../quickstart.md)的训练循环，本教程新增编码器-解码器结构以及编码器后验与 "
"QBM 先验之间的 KL 项。"

