#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:43
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A standard VAE uses a Gaussian prior $p(\\mathbf{z})$ and an encoder "
"$q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$. A Q-VAE replaces the Gaussian prior "
"with a QBM:"
msgstr ""
"标准 VAE 使用高斯先验 $p(\\mathbf{z})$ 与编码器 "
"$q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$。Q-VAE 用 QBM 替代高斯先验："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:51
msgid "The three components are:"
msgstr "三个核心组件为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Encoder**: maps the input image $\\mathbf{x}$ to the approximate "
"posterior $q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$, parameterized by a neural "
"network."
msgstr ""
"**编码器**：将输入图像 $\\mathbf{x}$ 映射到近似后验 "
"$q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$，由神经网络参数化。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:54
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**QBM prior**: models the latent distribution $p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z})$ "
"using a quantum Boltzmann machine instead of a Gaussian."
msgstr "**QBM 先验**：使用量子玻尔兹曼机而非高斯分布来建模隐分布 $p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z})$。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:55
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Decoder**: maps the latent sample $\\mathbf{z}$ back to data space, "
"reconstructing the input as a Bernoulli distribution."
msgstr "**解码器**：将隐样本 $\\mathbf{z}$ 映射回数据空间，以伯努利分布重建输入。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:57
msgid "The training objective is the quantum evidence lower bound (Q-ELBO):"
msgstr "训练目标是量子证据下界（Q-ELBO）："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:59
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Q-ELBO}} = "
"\\mathbb{E}_{q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})} [\\log "
"p_\\theta(\\mathbf{x}|\\mathbf{z})] - "
"\\tilde{H}(q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x}) \\| p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z}))\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{Q-ELBO}} = "
"\\mathbb{E}_{q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})} [\\log "
"p_\\theta(\\mathbf{x}|\\mathbf{z})] - "
"\\tilde{H}(q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x}) \\| p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z}))\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The first term is the reconstruction loss: how well the decoder "
"reconstructs the input from the latent sample. The second term is a KL-"
"like divergence that pulls the encoder posterior "
"$q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$ toward the QBM prior "
"$p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z})$."
msgstr ""
"第一项是重建损失：解码器从隐样本重建输入的效果。第二项是类 KL 散度，将编码器后验 "
"$q_\\phi(\\mathbf{z}|\\mathbf{x})$ 拉向 QBM 先验 $p_\\theta(\\mathbf{z})$。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_mnist.md:65
msgid ""
"The QBM prior is trained using the same positive/negative phase as an "
"RBM: positive phase from the encoder samples, negative phase from QBM "
"sampling. The sampler can be switched between `sa` (classical simulated "
"annealing) and `cim` (quantum CIM) via the `--sampler-type` flag — the "
"rest of the pipeline is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"QBM 先验使用与 RBM 相同的正相/负相训练：正相来自编码器采样，负相来自 QBM 采样。采样器可通过 `--sampler-type` "
"参数在 `sa`（经典模拟退火）与 `cim`（量子 CIM）之间切换——流水线其余部分保持不变。"

